  <ItemGroup>
    <!-- No ObjectFileName override here on purpose. It used to be
         $(IntDir)/%(RelativeDir)/, and for the shared sources below
         %(RelativeDir) begins with "..\", so their .obj files were written to
         x64\$(Configuration)\..\CecTest\ - which is x64\CecTest\, outside the
         configuration folder entirely. Debug and Release overwrote each other
         there, and the next build linked whichever half survived, failing with
         LNK2038 iterator-level and runtime-library mismatches. The default is
         $(IntDir), which keeps every configuration's objects to itself. -->
